codex
I found the toolchain failure’s concrete cause: this sandbox exposes `/proc/self/exe` but hides `/proc/<current-pid>/exe`; Lean 4.22 asks for the latter and therefore cannot locate its own application. I’ll use a narrowly scoped preload shim that redirects only that self-executable lookup, then rerun the exact pinned toolchain checks. This changes no candidate or provenance input.
apply patch
